{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c4a1","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0adbb-d982-7d33-a597-bf4c4953f6b8"},"sequence":171,"recorded_at":1780531400000337,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"5d52738d-e67a-4909-b1e5-6f3604d03379","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"5d52738d-e67a-4909-b1e5-6f3604d03379","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"5d52738d-e67a-4909-b1e5-6f3604d03379"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0adbc-3b78-7610-9be1-cde1395b9171"},"task_id":"01a0adbc-3b78-7610-9be1-cde1395b9171","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0adbc-3b78-7610-9be1-cde1395b9171","chunk":"Read text file `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.task-board/.resources/TASK-260830-kp4zpu/TASK-260830-kp4zpu_conformance-matrix.md`.\n1|# TASK-260830-kp4zpu conformance matrix\n2|\n3|Authority: relux-works/agent-session-manager-spec v0.6.0\n4|(`0cbdf100dbf84df50c64f792b1f940e3a67859a6`); section numbers below\n5|are the retained v0.6.0 headings. Historical v0.5.0\n6|(`28bf96d7dd7ebf3cd9e2ccd91d35b8660699dd5c`) behavior is unchanged:\n7|the Section 8 and NativeDiscoveryProof rows cited here are\n8|byte-identical in both revisions, and every retained entry below\n9|keeps its existing tests green.\n10|\n11|Legend: owner THIS LEAF = new production in `internal/provhost`\n12|(`identity_create.go`, `identity_bind.go`); RETAINED = landed code\n13|reused unchanged; SIBLING = TASK-260830-3uzfyn (profile\n14|resolution/persistence, runs after this leaf). Every THIS LEAF row\n15|names its production call site and its named committed tests.\n16|\n17|## 2.4 Execution profiles\n18|\n19|| Clause | Owner | Test(s) |\n20|| --- | --- | --- |\n21|| Persisted enum standard/yolo; Session Record creation value; `profile.changed` derivation; losing-lease exclusion | SIBLING | None here (identity records carry no profile member; verifiable in `identityMembers`) |\n22|| Resume fails `profile_mapping_unavailable` when the adapter cannot map the stored profile | SIBLING | None here |\n23|| P0/E1/C1 end-to-end fixtures (direct/takeover/resume/fork, task-board, Pi equal-mapping) | SIBLING | None here |\n24|| Pi equal-mapping disclosure (both profiles, one tool set) | RETAINED (`ProfileMapping`) + SIBLING flows | `TestProfileYOLOMappingIsDerivedFromSpec` (retained) |\n25|\n26|## 5.5 Provider Identity Record\n27|\n28|| Clause | Owner | Test(s) |\n29|| --- | --- | --- |\n30|| Closed 16-member `urn:ax:schema:provider-identity` 1.0.0 shape | RETAINED + THIS LEAF (`CreateIdentity` emits) | `TestCreateIdentityEmitsAttestedRecord` (passes `CheckIdentity`, owner shape, binding attestation); `TestIdentityMembersAreDerivedFromSpec` (retained) |\n31|| `subject_id` equals `session_id` | THIS LEAF (single `SessionID` param fans out to both) | `TestCreateIdentityEmitsAttestedRecord`; `TestCreateIdentityRefusals/session_id` |\n32|| `provider_version` 1..128, `provider_version_range` 1..256 (opaque), `native_session_id` 1..512 exact, UUIDv7 members, timestamp member | THIS LEAF (`CreateIdentity`) | `TestCreateIdentityRefusals` (one row per arm) |\n33|| `identity_kind` closed enum (5) | THIS LEAF + RETAINED (`isIdentityKind`) | `TestCreateIdentityRefusals/kind`; N-create-kind killed |\n34|| Key grammar `[a-z][a-z0-9_.-]{0,63}`, map 0..32, string values 1..1024 | THIS LEAF (`checkCreateOpaque`) | `TestCreateIdentityRefusals` (opaque rows) |\n35|| Absolute-path prefix refusal (decidable half) | THIS LEAF (`checkCreateOpaque`) | `TestCreateIdentityRefusals/opaque_absolute_prefix`; N-create-opaque-abs killed (token-preserving `/` swap) |\n36|| Antigravity `backend_conversation_uuid` requires non-null realm | THIS LEAF (`CreateIdentity`) | `TestCreateIdentityAntigravityRecord` (positive); `TestCreateIdentityRefusals/realm_required`; N-create-realm-required killed |\n37|| Extensions reverse-DNS keys, 0..64 | THIS LEAF (`checkCreateExtensions`) + owner backstop