0 AC rows driven through the named production entries; the\n30|tenth (crash evidence) is a stated bound: the entries are pure and\n31|mutate no durable state, so no crash/restart probe applies. Per-row\n32|call sites, tests, and bounds: `internal/provhost/TRACEABILITY.md`.\n33|Clause-level mapping: `TASK-260830-kp4zpu_conformance-matrix.md`.\n34|\n35|## Tests\n36|\n37|- New behavior tests: `identity_create_test.go`,\n38|  `identity_bind_test.go` (positives, refusal tables, derivation\n39|  tests, `Host.Call` identify-session round trip of a created\n40|  record).\n41|- 50 new refusal arms, each witnessed in\n42|  `declaredOperationWitnessesIdentityCreate`\n43|  (`refusal_arm_operations_d_test.go`); 217/217 derived arms\n44|  witnessed, floor raised 166 -> 217; every constructor site\n45|  carries an exercised negative path (runtime audit green).\n46|- Two new vocabulary derivations: `resumeProviders` from the\n47|  Section 8.2 table, `discoveryMembers` from the Section 7.5 type\n48|  row; census 24/24.\n49|- One cross-package registration: the shared `reverseDNSPattern`\n50|  grammar copy ledgered in `internal/environ/census_test.go`\n51|  (required by `TestSharedGrammarsAreOneLanguage`; first full run\n52|  caught the fresh-name copy, fixed by rename + ledger row).\n53|- Mutants: shipped `internal/provhost/testdata/mutate_identity.py`,\n54|  executed on the exact final source: 24/24 applied N plants\n55|  KILLED (incl. two token-preserving: opaque `/` suffix-swap, muse\n56|  `0.1.0` admission), harmless control SURVIVED, NOT_APPLIED and\n57|  COMPILE_OR_HARNESS_FAILURE outside the numerator. Per-plant raw\n58|  logs + `mutants.json` in the evidence tarball.\n59|\n60|## Validation (this session, real exits)\n61|\n62|- `gofmt` clean, `go build ./...`, `go vet ./...`: pass.\n63|- `go test ./... -count=1`: EXIT=0, 26 packages ok (after the\n64|  grammar-rename fix; the pre-fix run failed only\n65|  `TestSharedGrammarsAreOneLanguage`, fixed, re-run green).\n66|- `go test ./... -race -count=1`: EXIT=0, 26 packages ok (log\n67|  `gotest-race.log`).\n68|- `go test ./... -cover -count=1`: EXIT=0, 26 packages ok (log\n69|  `gotest-cover.log`).\n70|- 13/13 fuzz seed gates pass (scalar x1, canonicaljson x4,\n71|  secconftest x8, 100x each).\n72|- `tracecheck`: ok (contracts=63, sections=36, cases=101);\n73|  `cataloggen -check`: pass.\n74|- `GOOS=linux` / `GOOS=windows` builds: pass; JSON validation:\n75|  pass; `task-board validate`: exit 0 (no issues on this\n76|  task/story); `git diff --check`: pass.\n77|- provhost coverage: 85.6% of statements.\n78|\n79|## Bounds and non-claims\n80|\n81|- Section 2.4 profile authority is sibling-owned\n82|  (TASK-260830-3uzfyn); version ranges stay opaque; only Muse\n83|  carries a cell-level version pin; discovery binding is\n84|  at-or-under with byte-exact comparison; no `VerifyObjectIdentity`\n85|  call site added outside `internal/sessrepo` (retained bound\n86|  holds); no CLI/doctor/capability surface added or changed.\n87|\n88|## Files changed (uncommitted candidate)\n89|\n90|- `internal/provhost/identity_create.go` (new),\n91|  `internal/provhost/identity_bind.go` (new),\n92|  `internal/provhost/identity_create_test.go` (new),\n93|  `internal/provhost/identity_bind_test.go` (new),\n94|  `internal/provhost/refusal_arm_operations_d_test.go` (new),\n95|  `internal/provhost/testdata/mutate_identity.py` (new),\n96|  `internal/provhost/TRACEABILITY.md` (new),\n97|  `internal/provhost/refusal_arm_inventory_test.go` (witness wiring\n98|  + floor 217), `internal/provhost/closed_vocabulary_census_test.go`\n99|  (2 derivations + 2 bogus rows), `internal/provhost/doc.go`\n100|  (Section 8.2 accuracy), `internal/environ/census_test.go`\n101|  (grammar ledger row), `README.md` (operation-layer sentence),\n102|  `LOGBOOK.md` (entry).","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
